格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness 子 Agent 派发插件：按任务为子代理选模型、推理强度与工具范围，常用组合存成命名方案随时复用；内置安全检查、成本估算与节省分析、完整派发决策台账。","id":"gh:1340202790","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-subagent-profile","slug":"muzyLink/dsh-subagent-profile","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","subagent"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness 子 Agent 派发插件：按任务为子代理选模型、推理强度与工具范围，常用组合存成命名方案随时复用；内置安全检查、成本估算与节省分析、完整派发决策台账。"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-subagent-profile"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"子 Agent 派发插件 —— 派发可控 · 成本有数 · 决策留痕"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"English · 中文"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"For DeepSeek Harness (DSH)."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"> Dispatch subagents in DeepSeek Harness: pick model, reasoning effort, and tool scope per task; sav"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"e common combos as named profiles for reuse. Built-in safety checks, cost estimation with savings an"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"alysis, and a full decision ledger."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Why this plugin"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"| | Built-in `subagent` | `dsh-subagent-profile` |"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"| Per-subtask model / preset | ✅ optional `provider` / `model` / `reasoning_effort` (after enabling "},{"id":"p9s2","text":"model selection) | ✅ one profile bundles preset + model + effort + tool scope + budget; overridable "},{"id":"p9s3","text":"per call |\n| Reusable named setups | ❌ | ✅ profiles |\n| Tool-scope narrowing | ❌ | ✅ whitelist ∩ par"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"ent, `run_code` always removed |\n| Safety checks | ❌ | ✅ whitelist / cost / intersection / approval "},{"id":"p9s5","text":"/ budget, all recorded |\n| Cost visibility | ❌ | ✅ per-dispatch estimate + savings comparison |\n| De"},{"id":"p9s6","text":"cision ledger | ❌ | ✅ full trace: request vs. effective, checks, execution, settlement |\n| GUI manag"},{"id":"p9s7","text":"ement | ❌ | ✅ settings page + per-session ledger tab |\n| Performance-based suggestions | ❌ | ✅ confi"},{"id":"p9s8","text":"rm to apply, undo anytime |\n| Official model-selection interplay | ✅ enforced natively once enabled "},{"id":"p9s9","text":"| ✅ dispatch follows the same whitelist (out-of-range routes are rejected) |\n| Strategy object & exp"},{"id":"p9s10","text":"licit auto | ❌ | ✅ `strategy` object / explicit `auto` resolution (scheme → parent → default) |\n| In"},{"id":"p9s11","text":"herited-change confirmation | ❌ | ✅ `confirm` gate: non-explicit model changes require explicit conf"},{"id":"p9s12","text":"irmation before dispatch |\n| Session dispatch budget | ❌ | ✅ configurable session budget (tokens & c"},{"id":"p9s13","text":"oncurrency); dispatch stops with reminder at the cap |"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Installation"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Restart `dsh web`. This is a standard **bundle plugin**: it provides the `dispatch` tool, the profil"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"e provider, the `subagent-profiles` service, the `/subagent-profiles/*` loopback management routes, "},{"id":"p12s3","text":"the settings page (「子 Agent 方案」), the per-session ledger tab, and the `dispatch` tool-call card in t"},{"id":"p12s4","text":"he web GUI. On startup it also **self-installs an agent preset** — **`orchestrator-v2`** (「编排者模式 V2」"},{"id":"p12s5","text":") — pick it in the new-session preset picker. The sync is idempotent and re-runs on every startup, s"},{"id":"p12s6","text":"o upgrading the plugin updates the preset."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Usage"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"### 1. Configure sub-agent profiles"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Profiles are managed in the settings page — each one bundles preset + model + reasoning effort + too"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"l scope (and optionally a persona), and can be enabled, disabled, edited, or reset individually. Two"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"ionally a persona), and can be enabled, disabled, edited, or reset individually. Two built-ins ship:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"| Profile | Purpose |"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"| `swap-standard` | switch the child to the full standard coding toolkit |\n| `researcher` | deep rea"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"soning off, search-only tools |"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Profiles live in `~/.dsh/subagent-profiles.json` and take effect immediately (edits are made from th"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"`~/.dsh/subagent-profiles.json` and take effect immediately (edits are made from the settings page)."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"### 2. Dispatch per subtask — the `dispatch` tool"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"### 3. Review in the decision ledger"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Every session has a ledger tab that records each dispatch decision: what the parent saw and requeste"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"d, what actually took effect (with ignored-request highlights), which tools were removed and why, ho"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"w execution went (including stalls and parent interventions), and what it cost. Safety-check failure"},{"id":"p22s4","text":"s are surfaced with fix directions."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Safety model"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Delegation never lets a subagent gain more power than you already have — this is the default, with n"},{"id":"p24s2","text":" lets a subagent gain more power than you already have — this is the default, with no configuration:"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"- **Tools only shrink.** A child's tool set is the intersection of the profile's tools and the paren"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"t's tools, and `run_code` is always removed.\n- **Approval is never bypassed.** Delegation does not w"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"aive the host's approval requirements; operations that need approval are rejected automatically.\n- *"},{"id":"p25s4","text":"*Cost is capped.** Model, reasoning effort, tokens, and recursion depth are all bounded; out-of-rang"},{"id":"p25s5","text":"e values fail loudly instead of silently downgrading.\n- **An escape hatch, explicitly.** Non-officia"},{"id":"p25s6","text":"l presets can be allowed per-preset (default off, each allowance audited)."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Known limitations"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"- **Background dispatch** requires `@deepseek-ai/dsh-jobs` and `@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-jobs` to be lo"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"aded; otherwise it fails with \"dispatch: 后台派发不可用：缺少 jobs 服务\".\n- **Continuable mode** goes through th"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"e DSH standard composition path, so the `preset` swap and `reasoningEffort` are ignored (the child i"},{"id":"p27s4","text":"nherits the parent preset at the default reasoning effort).\n- **Continuable follow-ups** are deliver"},{"id":"p27s5","text":"ed through the official `send_message` channel (the plugin drives the child via the official child h"},{"id":"p27s6","text":"andle).\n- **Official model selection is a web-line feature**: the session policy for the built-in su"},{"id":"p27s7","text":"bagent tools ships with the web app and is not available in headless deployments. In production it i"},{"id":"p27s8","text":"s off by default and must be enabled before it takes effect.\n- **Who decides the child's final tool "},{"id":"p27s9","text":"set depends on the mode**:\n- Continuable: narrowed by this plugin up front — the child's `allow` = ("},{"id":"p27s10","text":"parent tool set − `run_code` − `deny`) ∩ `allow`. Assumption: continuable inherits the parent preset"},{"id":"p27s11","text":", so the child's tool set ≈ the parent's; if dsh's behavior changes so the two differ (e.g. a future"},{"id":"p27s12","text":" preset swap composing a different tool set), tool narrowing fails with a hard error (conservatively"},{"id":"p27s13","text":" safe — never silently granting more), to be replaced with a true parent ∩ child intersection once d"},{"id":"p27s14","text":"sh provides an official seam.\n- One-shot: decided by dsh; the plugin cannot read the final restricte"},{"id":"p27s15","text":"d result and the card reports \"tools are finally granted by the system\".\n- **Cost figures are estima"},{"id":"p27s16","text":"tes**: computed from an average per-dispatch price (measured once per model); fine-grained per-token"},{"id":"p27s17","text":" pricing is on the roadmap. The UI labels estimates as such and shows a note when the sample size is"},{"id":"p27s18","text":"g is on the roadmap. The UI labels estimates as such and shows a note when the sample size is small."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
